{"pageProps":{"meta":{"id":"obsidian:localbrain-h3-ltx25-video-practical-test","title":"H3 与 LTX-2.5：64GB Mac 本地视频实测，加速、过渡和镜头控制怎么选？","date":"2026-11-02","updated":"2026-11-03","summary":"64GB Mac的真实短片、H3同题加速、Transition首尾帧与Layout预演控制，以及方寸智匣完整用法。原片、参数和失败记录一起保留。","categories":[{"id":"markdown-category-0-技术分享","name":"技术分享","color":"default"}],"categoryNames":["技术分享"],"tags":[{"id":"markdown-tag-0-AI","name":"AI","color":"default"},{"id":"markdown-tag-1-本地部署","name":"本地部署","color":"default"},{"id":"markdown-tag-2-视频生成","name":"视频生成","color":"default"}],"image":"/obsidian-assets/localbrain-h3-ltx25-video-practical-test/cover-728bae0052ba.jpg","coverBlockId":null,"slug":"localbrain-h3-ltx25-video-practical-test","legacyPaths":[],"lang":"zh-CN","translationOf":null,"articleType":"article","discoveryName":"H3 与 LTX-2.5：64GB Mac 本地视频实测，加速、过渡和镜头控制怎么选？","discoveryCategory":null,"discoveryStage":null,"discoveryUrl":null,"source":"markdown","fixedProductFooter":true},"markdownHtml":"<p>黄雨衣里的姑娘把纸鹤放在掌心，纸鹤飞了起来；云海上的花园里，裙摆和蝴蝶一起移动；森林里还有一架钢琴。先看这几段：它们都由这台 M5 Pro、64GB 统一内存的 Mac，通过方寸智匣调用本地模型生成。</p>\n<p><figure class=\"article-video\"><video controls playsinline preload=\"none\" poster=\"/media-previews/82a4817a7f88d045466410a4-poster.webp\" aria-label=\"本机实测｜纸鹤雨巷\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:100%;aspect-ratio:864/480;background:#111;border-radius:12px\" src=\"/media-previews/82a4817a7f88d045466410a4-stream.mp4\"><a href=\"/media-previews/82a4817a7f88d045466410a4-stream.mp4\">本机实测｜纸鹤雨巷 ↗</a></video><figcaption><a href=\"/media-previews/82a4817a7f88d045466410a4-stream.mp4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">本机实测｜纸鹤雨巷 ↗</a></figcaption></figure></p>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/localbrain-h3-ltx25-video-practical-test/creative-01.mp4\">打开完整原声视频</a></p>\n<p><figure class=\"article-video\"><video controls playsinline preload=\"none\" poster=\"/media-previews/46466dac5451c1afcd0afca1-poster.webp\" aria-label=\"本机实测｜浮空花园\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:100%;aspect-ratio:864/480;background:#111;border-radius:12px\" src=\"/media-previews/46466dac5451c1afcd0afca1-stream.mp4\"><a href=\"/media-previews/46466dac5451c1afcd0afca1-stream.mp4\">本机实测｜浮空花园 ↗</a></video><figcaption><a href=\"/media-previews/46466dac5451c1afcd0afca1-stream.mp4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">本机实测｜浮空花园 ↗</a></figcaption></figure></p>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/localbrain-h3-ltx25-video-practical-test/creative-03.mp4\">打开完整原声视频</a></p>\n<p><figure class=\"article-video\"><video controls playsinline preload=\"none\" poster=\"/media-previews/9e4a68e16a1d9f138c2a59af-poster.webp\" aria-label=\"本机实测｜森林钢琴\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:100%;aspect-ratio:768/512;background:#111;border-radius:12px\" src=\"/media-previews/9e4a68e16a1d9f138c2a59af-stream.mp4\"><a href=\"/media-previews/9e4a68e16a1d9f138c2a59af-stream.mp4\">本机实测｜森林钢琴 ↗</a></video><figcaption><a href=\"/media-previews/9e4a68e16a1d9f138c2a59af-stream.mp4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">本机实测｜森林钢琴 ↗</a></figcaption></figure></p>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/localbrain-h3-ltx25-video-practical-test/creative-06.mp4\">打开完整原声视频</a></p>\n<p>它们各约3.04秒。纸鹤和花园用 H3 四步加速，分别等待177.55秒、171.49秒；钢琴用 LTX-2.5 普通蒸馏流程，等待79.87秒。题材、画幅和算法不同，先把这些数字当成做一条素材要等多久的实用参考。判断谁更快，要回到后面的同题对照。</p>\n<p>这次我想回答的，是把视频模型放进自己的工具之后，怎样选才省时间：什么时候用四步，什么时候需要首尾帧，什么时候应该先做一个粗糙的镜头预演。测试分成11月1日的独立管线对照、2.2.7安装版超短调用，以及11月2日2.2.8候选版的六段创意样片。本文重新整理原片与回执，没有重新跑模型。</p>\n<p>动态预览按原速显示，动图没有声音；博客与录制阅读版可打开完整原声视频。公众号保留动态画面与关键帧，完整声音请到文末的博客入口播放。</p>\n<h2>先分清三件事：少等一会儿、顺利转场、按镜头拍</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>要解决的问题</th>\n<th>本期用到的能力</th>\n<th>需要准备的输入</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>快速看创意方向</td>\n<td>H3 四步／八步加速</td>\n<td>提示词；按所选方式提供参考图</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>从一张画面走到另一张</td>\n<td>LTX Transition</td>\n<td>首帧、尾帧、过渡描述</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>先安排运动与构图</td>\n<td>LTX Layout to Render</td>\n<td>几何预演视频、同构图外观参考图、描述</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>LoRA 可以理解成给已有机器换一组调校零件。零件的用途不一样：有的教模型少算几轮，有的偏向过渡连续性，有的接收镜头与几何位置。把任何一个都叫“画质增强开关”，很容易选错。它们仍然依赖对应基础模型和推理流程，不能只下载一份小适配器就开始生成。</p>\n<p>来源也要分清。H3 Turbo 来自 LightX2V 项目；Transition 来自社区作者 joyfox，训练基础是 LTX-2.3；Layout to Render 来自 Lightricks 官方。本轮为了复用已有模型，在 LTX-2.5 上测试 Transition 兼容配方，后面会把这项区别带到实际结果里。</p>\n<h2>H3 四步，究竟省下多少等待？</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/localbrain-h3-ltx25-video-practical-test/h3-time-comparison.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/6eba751699315cb980bfe359-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/6eba751699315cb980bfe359-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/localbrain-h3-ltx25-video-practical-test/h3-time-comparison.png\" alt=\"同题生成耗时\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1500\" height=\"680\"></picture></a></p>\n<p>我给三档同一个任务：红色玩具车在浅灰地面向前行驶，镜头贴近车轮跟随；希望车身保持形状与颜色，带轻微电机声和一次短喇叭。统一864×480、124帧、24帧/秒、种子4242，成片都是约5.17秒。</p>\n<p><figure class=\"article-video\"><video controls playsinline preload=\"none\" poster=\"/media-previews/49ff2f093186d968df02c3e4-poster.webp\" aria-label=\"本机实测｜H3 普通参考，16次前向\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:100%;aspect-ratio:864/480;background:#111;border-radius:12px\" src=\"/media-previews/49ff2f093186d968df02c3e4-stream.mp4\"><a href=\"/media-previews/49ff2f093186d968df02c3e4-stream.mp4\">本机实测｜H3 普通参考，16次前向 ↗</a></video><figcaption><a href=\"/media-previews/49ff2f093186d968df02c3e4-stream.mp4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">本机实测｜H3 普通参考，16次前向 ↗</a></figcaption></figure></p>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/localbrain-h3-ltx25-video-practical-test/h3-standard-16.mp4\">打开完整原声视频</a></p>\n<p><figure class=\"article-video\"><video controls playsinline preload=\"none\" poster=\"/media-previews/9a1fa706ac40ebbcbe8a677b-poster.webp\" aria-label=\"本机实测｜H3 四步加速\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:100%;aspect-ratio:864/480;background:#111;border-radius:12px\" src=\"/media-previews/9a1fa706ac40ebbcbe8a677b-stream.mp4\"><a href=\"/media-previews/9a1fa706ac40ebbcbe8a677b-stream.mp4\">本机实测｜H3 四步加速 ↗</a></video><figcaption><a href=\"/media-previews/9a1fa706ac40ebbcbe8a677b-stream.mp4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">本机实测｜H3 四步加速 ↗</a></figcaption></figure></p>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/localbrain-h3-ltx25-video-practical-test/h3-turbo-4.mp4\">打开完整原声视频</a></p>\n<p><figure class=\"article-video\"><video controls playsinline preload=\"none\" poster=\"/media-previews/0809b7cb19787533982956fe-poster.webp\" aria-label=\"本机实测｜H3 八步加速\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:100%;aspect-ratio:864/480;background:#111;border-radius:12px\" src=\"/media-previews/0809b7cb19787533982956fe-stream.mp4\"><a href=\"/media-previews/0809b7cb19787533982956fe-stream.mp4\">本机实测｜H3 八步加速 ↗</a></video><figcaption><a href=\"/media-previews/0809b7cb19787533982956fe-stream.mp4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">本机实测｜H3 八步加速 ↗</a></figcaption></figure></p>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/localbrain-h3-ltx25-video-practical-test/h3-turbo-8.mp4\">打开完整原声视频</a></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方式</th>\n<th>总耗时</th>\n<th>MLX活动峰值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>普通参考：16次前向</td>\n<td>14分41.9秒</td>\n<td>25.68 GiB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>四步加速</td>\n<td>4分57.0秒</td>\n<td>27.22 GiB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>八步加速</td>\n<td>8分19.4秒</td>\n<td>27.29 GiB</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>每档一次，包含本轮加载、采样、解码与封装；MLX活动峰值不等于整机内存占用。</p>\n<p>四步本组约快2.97倍，等待时间缩短约66.3%；八步约快1.77倍。这里的普通参考是本轮16次前向的单条件路径。最初一条与最后一段下载有过重叠，所以我把它作为这次工作流的耗时对照，不拿它给所有硬件、所有官方高质量配方排位。</p>\n<p>“步”也容易误会。它描述生成过程主要计算的轮数，帧数描述成片有多少幅画面。四步照样可以生成124帧。回执里还会看到5个采样时间点对应4次实际前向，因此只看界面或某个 steps 字段，可能误读真正计算了几轮。</p>\n<p>这组小车三档都能看出完整主体，但车款与镜头角度有变化。四步适合先看创意、动作和构图；八步可以另试一种取舍，目前这一组不足以断言八步必然更好。Mac 适配使用八位骨干和完整32位视频解码，原画幅与原声音保留；这与官方全量BF16骨干的逐数值效果不是同一份验收。</p>\n<h2>换成创意镜头，先看它到底听懂了什么</h2>\n<p><figure class=\"article-video\"><video controls playsinline preload=\"none\" poster=\"/media-previews/b5641291f481eae5be7d5c81-poster.webp\" aria-label=\"本机实测｜掌心星球，H3 八步\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:100%;aspect-ratio:864/480;background:#111;border-radius:12px\" src=\"/media-previews/b5641291f481eae5be7d5c81-stream.mp4\"><a href=\"/media-previews/b5641291f481eae5be7d5c81-stream.mp4\">本机实测｜掌心星球，H3 八步 ↗</a></video><figcaption><a href=\"/media-previews/b5641291f481eae5be7d5c81-stream.mp4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">本机实测｜掌心星球，H3 八步 ↗</a></figcaption></figure></p>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/localbrain-h3-ltx25-video-practical-test/creative-02.mp4\">打开完整原声视频</a></p>\n<p><figure class=\"article-video\"><video controls playsinline preload=\"none\" poster=\"/media-previews/81746a3ab64df595ee82bb2c-poster.webp\" aria-label=\"本机实测｜纸牌蝴蝶，LTX-2.5\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:100%;aspect-ratio:768/512;background:#111;border-radius:12px\" src=\"/media-previews/81746a3ab64df595ee82bb2c-stream.mp4\"><a href=\"/media-previews/81746a3ab64df595ee82bb2c-stream.mp4\">本机实测｜纸牌蝴蝶，LTX-2.5 ↗</a></video><figcaption><a href=\"/media-previews/81746a3ab64df595ee82bb2c-stream.mp4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">本机实测｜纸牌蝴蝶，LTX-2.5 ↗</a></figcaption></figure></p>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/localbrain-h3-ltx25-video-practical-test/creative-05.mp4\">打开完整原声视频</a></p>\n<p><figure class=\"article-video\"><video controls playsinline preload=\"none\" poster=\"/media-previews/596f9f1bd8b4019340fbddac-poster.webp\" aria-label=\"本机实测｜月球旅行，竖屏\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:100%;aspect-ratio:480/864;background:#111;border-radius:12px\" src=\"/media-previews/596f9f1bd8b4019340fbddac-stream.mp4\"><a href=\"/media-previews/596f9f1bd8b4019340fbddac-stream.mp4\">本机实测｜月球旅行，竖屏 ↗</a></video><figcaption><a href=\"/media-previews/596f9f1bd8b4019340fbddac-stream.mp4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">本机实测｜月球旅行，竖屏 ↗</a></figcaption></figure></p>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/localbrain-h3-ltx25-video-practical-test/creative-04.mp4\">打开完整原声视频</a></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>方式／画幅</th>\n<th>约3.04秒成片的等待</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>纸鹤雨巷</td>\n<td>H3四步／864×480</td>\n<td>177.55秒</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>掌心星球</td>\n<td>H3八步／864×480</td>\n<td>279.35秒</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>浮空花园</td>\n<td>H3四步／864×480</td>\n<td>171.49秒</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>月球旅行</td>\n<td>H3四步／480×864</td>\n<td>181.24秒</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>纸牌蝴蝶</td>\n<td>LTX普通／768×512</td>\n<td>71.85秒</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>森林钢琴</td>\n<td>LTX普通／768×512</td>\n<td>79.87秒</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>纸鹤的任务比较集中：手中一只纸鹤，向上飞，人物跟着看。拿它做插入镜头很直观。掌心星球要同时维持透明球体、里面的蓝色星球和手部关系；录制时可以放大这些交界处看，别只停在最好看的一帧。</p>\n<p>月球旅行则留下了一个很适合讲的偏差：原要求是“机器人柯基”，结果画面里出现普通柯基和另一个独立机器人。画面生成了，词的组合关系却没完全照做。这个样本我保留，不把它剪掉后再说提示词都能听懂。</p>\n<p>六段中 H3 的 MLX 活动峰值约25.67—25.69 GiB，LTX两段约20.97 GiB。两者不是整机总占用，也不能和进程RSS直接相加。短片通常更容易试错；想做连续角色、精确台词或商业广告，还要另测身份、手部、标识和声音。</p>\n<h2>Transition：首尾帧接上了，车轮有没有跟上？</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/localbrain-h3-ltx25-video-practical-test/car-red-first.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/b082f4cc4238258c81c4b924-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/b082f4cc4238258c81c4b924-768.webp 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/localbrain-h3-ltx25-video-practical-test/car-red-first.png\" alt=\"输入首帧\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"768\" height=\"512\"></picture></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/localbrain-h3-ltx25-video-practical-test/car-blue-last.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/1fc1f60b8628d129963fcf7f-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/1fc1f60b8628d129963fcf7f-768.webp 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/localbrain-h3-ltx25-video-practical-test/car-blue-last.png\" alt=\"输入尾帧\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"768\" height=\"512\"></picture></a></p>\n<p>这个任务从红色小车变到蓝色小车，输入两张图，并保持同一组种子和采样设置。先不加载 Transition，再加载它，看中间过程发生什么。与普通文字生视频相比，首尾帧像是给导航设了起点和终点，适配器要改善的是中间怎样走过去。</p>\n<p><figure class=\"article-video\"><video controls playsinline preload=\"none\" poster=\"/media-previews/2ef5165cbecf230d8875a43c-poster.webp\" aria-label=\"本机实测｜首尾帧基线\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:100%;aspect-ratio:768/512;background:#111;border-radius:12px\" src=\"/media-previews/2ef5165cbecf230d8875a43c-stream.mp4\"><a href=\"/media-previews/2ef5165cbecf230d8875a43c-stream.mp4\">本机实测｜首尾帧基线 ↗</a></video><figcaption><a href=\"/media-previews/2ef5165cbecf230d8875a43c-stream.mp4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">本机实测｜首尾帧基线 ↗</a></figcaption></figure></p>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/localbrain-h3-ltx25-video-practical-test/ltx25-transition-baseline.mp4\">打开完整原声视频</a></p>\n<p><figure class=\"article-video\"><video controls playsinline preload=\"none\" poster=\"/media-previews/5e97a18152dc83bbfd35de9f-poster.webp\" aria-label=\"本机实测｜Transition 兼容配方\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:100%;aspect-ratio:768/512;background:#111;border-radius:12px\" src=\"/media-previews/5e97a18152dc83bbfd35de9f-stream.mp4\"><a href=\"/media-previews/5e97a18152dc83bbfd35de9f-stream.mp4\">本机实测｜Transition 兼容配方 ↗</a></video><figcaption><a href=\"/media-previews/5e97a18152dc83bbfd35de9f-stream.mp4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">本机实测｜Transition 兼容配方 ↗</a></figcaption></figure></p>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/localbrain-h3-ltx25-video-practical-test/ltx25-transition-lora.mp4\">打开完整原声视频</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/localbrain-h3-ltx25-video-practical-test/transition-comparison.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/14e503dbc04f481f1a9934fd-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/14e503dbc04f481f1a9934fd-1152.webp 1152w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/localbrain-h3-ltx25-video-practical-test/transition-comparison.jpg\" alt=\"过渡诊断对照\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1152\" height=\"668\"></picture></a></p>\n<p>768×512、121帧、约5.04秒，基线耗时108.57秒，加载 Transition 后112.68秒。基线在第15、60、105帧能看到车轮与车身分离或形变；适配后这些诊断帧的车轮连接更稳定，红蓝转换也完成了。中间仍有颜色分段，棋盘地面形变没有消失。</p>\n<p>所以我会把它用于有明确起止图的过渡尝试，不把它当成一个加速按钮。它比本组基线还多用约4秒。社区模型训练在2.3，本轮576对适配层在2.5上匹配成功；已经观察到可用结果，原生2.3、复杂人脸和其它镜头仍然需要分别验证。</p>\n<h2>Layout：先给模型一段粗糙的镜头预演</h2>\n<p><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/localbrain-h3-ltx25-video-practical-test/car-layout.gif\" alt=\"本地自制｜几何预演\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p>\n<p>Layout 的做法更接近先排练再拍摄。灰色方块小车提供位置、方向和运动；外观图负责颜色、材质与光线。Lightricks 的官方方案也强调这两份输入的分工，外观图应从预演首帧建立，保持构图关系。<a href=\"https://huggingface.co/Lightricks/LTX-2.5-22b-IC-LoRA-Layout-To-Render\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"在新窗口打开 · https://huggingface.co/Lightricks/LTX-2.5-22b-IC-LoRA-Layout-To-Render\">查看官方说明与工作流</a>。</p>\n<p><figure class=\"article-video\"><video controls playsinline preload=\"none\" poster=\"/media-previews/208119a02f8c031ac454ba9b-poster.webp\" aria-label=\"本机探索｜参考图构图不一致\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:100%;aspect-ratio:768/512;background:#111;border-radius:12px\" src=\"/media-previews/208119a02f8c031ac454ba9b-stream.mp4\"><a href=\"/media-previews/208119a02f8c031ac454ba9b-stream.mp4\">本机探索｜参考图构图不一致 ↗</a></video><figcaption><a href=\"/media-previews/208119a02f8c031ac454ba9b-stream.mp4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">本机探索｜参考图构图不一致 ↗</a></figcaption></figure></p>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/localbrain-h3-ltx25-video-practical-test/ltx25-layout-to-render.mp4\">打开完整原声视频</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/localbrain-h3-ltx25-video-practical-test/layout-look-still.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/b082f4cc4238258c81c4b924-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/b082f4cc4238258c81c4b924-768.webp 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/localbrain-h3-ltx25-video-practical-test/layout-look-still.png\" alt=\"同构图外观参考\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"768\" height=\"512\"></picture></a></p>\n<p><figure class=\"article-video\"><video controls playsinline preload=\"none\" poster=\"/media-previews/68edb2412f321d22b4548ea8-poster.webp\" aria-label=\"本机实测｜同构图参考补测\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:100%;aspect-ratio:768/512;background:#111;border-radius:12px\" src=\"/media-previews/68edb2412f321d22b4548ea8-stream.mp4\"><a href=\"/media-previews/68edb2412f321d22b4548ea8-stream.mp4\">本机实测｜同构图参考补测 ↗</a></video><figcaption><a href=\"/media-previews/68edb2412f321d22b4548ea8-stream.mp4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">本机实测｜同构图参考补测 ↗</a></figcaption></figure></p>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/localbrain-h3-ltx25-video-practical-test/ltx25-layout-aligned-reference.mp4\">打开完整原声视频</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/localbrain-h3-ltx25-video-practical-test/layout-comparison.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/1fc57dbadc1341ccfa5d6a5d-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/1fc57dbadc1341ccfa5d6a5d-1152.webp 1152w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/localbrain-h3-ltx25-video-practical-test/layout-comparison.jpg\" alt=\"预演与两次输出对照\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1152\" height=\"973\"></picture></a></p>\n<p>第一次，我拿另一条 H3 视频的写实红车帧当外观图。成片确实接近那辆写实车，但车辆大小、位置和镜头关系没严格跟着灰色预演。第二次改用同一预演的彩色首帧，并同步修改描述，红色方块车随驱动向右移动，诊断帧没有看到车轮脱离。</p>\n<p>两次都是768×512、81帧、约3.38秒，耗时约145秒。补测调整了参考图和描述两个输入，因此不把改善全部归因到其中一个变量。这个结果足以展示正确准备材料的重要性，复杂人物、精确几何误差和高分辨率还没有因此自动通过。</p>\n<p>声音也要如实说：同构图补测虽然有音轨，整体响度约−95.7 dBFS，接近静音。想做有声片段时，需要真正播放原声，不能看到一个AAC流就宣布声音效果好了。本期不对原片做增益，把问题一起保留。</p>\n<h2>在方寸智匣里怎么用：选模型，再选可用能力</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/localbrain-h3-ltx25-video-practical-test/ui-h3-result.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/04a49b66ea34ac87e3b90deb-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/04a49b66ea34ac87e3b90deb-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/localbrain-h3-ltx25-video-practical-test/ui-h3-result.jpg\" alt=\"安装版 H3 结果\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2360\" height=\"1456\"></picture></a></p>\n<p>软件入口统一为一条顺序：发现页准备模型及可选能力；对话页打开本地多媒体工具，进入视频生成；先选择这次使用的模型，再选生成方式、加速和参数。H3四步／八步在H3模型下，Transition／Layout在LTX模型下。关闭加速或切回普通生成时，已有模型与文件保留。</p>\n<ol>\n<li>在“发现”选择模型目录。已有文件用“使用已有文件／选择模型目录”复用；新用户先核对缺少哪些基础权重、适配器和环境。模型与缓存可以放外置盘。</li>\n<li>打开对话中的视频工具，先选模型。H3选择普通、四步或八步；LTX按任务选择普通文字、首尾帧或预演转成片。</li>\n<li>先填输入，再定画幅、帧数和种子。Transition提供首尾图；Layout提供同构图参考和与请求等长的24帧/秒预演，不把不匹配的长视频直接塞进去。</li>\n<li>提交后等原任务完成，播放完整原声，检查真实输出尺寸；保留提示词、种子、回执与日志，以便重试和比较。</li>\n</ol>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>安装版2.2.7调用</th>\n<th>真实输出</th>\n<th>耗时</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>H3四步</td>\n<td>256×256／22帧</td>\n<td>21.56秒</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>H3八步</td>\n<td>256×256／22帧</td>\n<td>25.96秒</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Transition</td>\n<td>384×256／25帧</td>\n<td>27.61秒</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Layout</td>\n<td>384×256／25帧</td>\n<td>33.28秒</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>四条约一秒小样用于确认安装版调用，不能拿来估算五秒720P速度。</p>\n<p>这四个能力先在2.2.7安装版逐项点选，回执分别核对4／8次真实前向、Transition的576对适配层，以及Layout的480对适配层。随后2.2.8候选版增加了下面的分辨率预设和即时检查，并用前面的六段3秒小样验证调用。当前公开包与候选包请以发行页和本机版本为准，不把本地候选写成所有用户都已收到。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/localbrain-h3-ltx25-video-practical-test/ui-valid-preset.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/ab9a3a813eec50eb5c39604a-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/ab9a3a813eec50eb5c39604a-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/localbrain-h3-ltx25-video-practical-test/ui-valid-preset.jpg\" alt=\"分辨率预设与内存提示\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2360\" height=\"1456\"></picture></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/localbrain-h3-ltx25-video-practical-test/ui-invalid-dimensions.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/a280097fb1e23fff9020ce68-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/a280097fb1e23fff9020ce68-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/localbrain-h3-ltx25-video-practical-test/ui-invalid-dimensions.jpg\" alt=\"输入尺寸的即时检查\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2360\" height=\"1456\"></picture></a></p>\n<p>H3这条原生配方要求宽高为32的倍数，LTX为64的倍数。普通1280×720里的720不符合它们的对齐条件，所以界面给出“接近720P”等合法预设，而不是先接收再等引擎报错。2.2.8候选中两者单边参数范围是256—1920；这个输入上限只表示软件允许的合法参数，不代表这台64GB Mac已跑过范围里的每一种组合。</p>\n<p>帧数同样有阶梯：H3采用17n＋5，LTX采用8n＋1。24帧/秒下，H3的124帧约5.17秒，LTX的121帧约5.04秒。增加画幅和帧数通常会增加等待与内存压力，界面按模型提示合法尺寸、片长和预算；内存峰值未知时提示风险，不能暗自降低尺寸、缩短片段或更换解码精度。</p>\n<h2>Pika 的高清旧片保留了，但别和这一轮混算</h2>\n<p><figure class=\"article-video\"><video controls playsinline preload=\"none\" poster=\"/media-previews/05e43eb805794fb40145ec8e-poster.webp\" aria-label=\"此前本机实测｜Pika 1344×768\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:100%;aspect-ratio:1344/768;background:#111;border-radius:12px\" src=\"/media-previews/05e43eb805794fb40145ec8e-stream.mp4\"><a href=\"/media-previews/05e43eb805794fb40145ec8e-stream.mp4\">此前本机实测｜Pika 1344×768 ↗</a></video><figcaption><a href=\"/media-previews/05e43eb805794fb40145ec8e-stream.mp4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">此前本机实测｜Pika 1344×768 ↗</a></figcaption></figure></p>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/localbrain-h3-ltx25-video-practical-test/Pika-720p-float32.mp4\">打开完整原声视频</a></p>\n<p>此前这台Mac已经生成过1344×768、124帧、约5.17秒的 Pika 原片，六步、完整32位视频解码，耗时1336.86秒，约22分17秒。MLX活动峰值29.55 GiB；阶段末同时刻活动加缓存最高约39.82 GiB，这是另一个口径。原音轨很轻，整体约−53.07 dBFS，没有做音量增强。</p>\n<p>这解释了当时为什么要修正内存预估，而不是看到“720P”就一刀切拒绝。不过它是此前的独立测试，不是这轮给H3、LTX做的统一速度题。按我的清理要求，Pika专用权重和环境后来移除了，原片、声音与验收记录仍在。要重新生成才需要重新准备；播放和剪这批既有素材不需要下载模型。<a href=\"https://hyphentech.top/pika-h3-flex-localbrain-mac/\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"在新窗口打开 · https://hyphentech.top/pika-h3-flex-localbrain-mac/\">此前Pika实测与官方演示</a>。</p>\n<h2>我会怎样用这几种能力</h2>\n<p>要做几秒钟的创意插入镜头，我会先用现有H3四步试方向，再逐帧挑手、物体和镜头关系。已经有起止画面时，Transition值得试一次；镜头路径必须跟着设计走时，先做简单几何预演，再用Layout，准备材料比把提示词再写长一倍更重要。</p>\n<p>H3和LTX的这些Mac结果依赖八位转换、专用管线和本期参数。它们已经能交付可以拿来剪辑的短镜头，长片一致性、复杂台词和最高规格仍要单独检验。原始视频里能看到的失误，我会和成功片一起给出来。这样下次升级时，才能拿相同输入复测，看改善到底发生在哪。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/HackerChi-Hub/localbrain-releases/releases\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"download\" title=\"在新窗口打开 · https://github.com/HackerChi-Hub/localbrain-releases/releases\">下载与更新：方寸智匣 LocalBrain</a> 是安装包发行页，模型权重需要另行准备，不能把软件包体积当成全部占用。Mac视频结果不代表Windows、Linux已完成相同推理验收。下载部分模型需要国际网络，Layout还需要本人在官方页面取得访问权限；软件不会代替你接受账号信息共享条款。</p>\n<p>公众号中的动图没有声音。想看完整原声，可进入<a href=\"https://hyphentech.top\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"在新窗口打开 · https://hyphentech.top\">黑粉科技博客</a>，按本文标题查找对应文章；博客版在每段动态样片旁提供完整视频入口。</p>\n<h2>模型来源与复现入口</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/lightx2v/Minimax-h3-Turbo\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"在新窗口打开 · https://huggingface.co/lightx2v/Minimax-h3-Turbo\">LightX2V H3 Turbo 权重与用法</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/joyfox/LTX-2.3-Transition-LORA\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"在新窗口打开 · https://huggingface.co/joyfox/LTX-2.3-Transition-LORA\">Transition 社区模型与训练基础</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/Lightricks/LTX-2.5-22b-IC-LoRA-Layout-To-Render\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"在新窗口打开 · https://huggingface.co/Lightricks/LTX-2.5-22b-IC-LoRA-Layout-To-Render\">Layout to Render 官方工作流</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/HackerChi-Hub/localbrain-releases/releases\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"download\" title=\"在新窗口打开 · https://github.com/HackerChi-Hub/localbrain-releases/releases\">方寸智匣下载与已知边界</a></li>\n</ul>\n","relatedPosts":[{"id":"obsidian:local-llm-hardware-guide-20261031","rawId":"obsidian:local-llm-hardware-guide-20261031","slug":"local-llm-hardware-guide-20261031","legacyPaths":[],"title":"为Qwen4提前选设备？Qwen3.8 27B、Flash-Next本地部署选购指南","date":"2026-10-31","updated":"2026-10-31","summary":"从27B、Flash-Next到9B与4B，按容量、带宽、引擎和整机成本比较设备。附本期33项候选及2026年10月30日报价快照。","categories":[{"id":"markdown-category-0-技术分享","name":"技术分享","color":"default"}],"categoryNames":["技术分享"],"tags":[{"id":"markdown-tag-0-AI","name":"AI","color":"default"},{"id":"markdown-tag-1-本地部署","name":"本地部署","color":"default"}],"pageCover":"/obsidian-assets/local-llm-hardware-guide-20261031/cover-880fe11d9e.jpg","cover":"/obsidian-assets/local-llm-hardware-guide-20261031/cover-880fe11d9e.jpg","source":"markdown","status":"published","lang":"zh-CN","translationOf":null,"articleType":"article","discoveryName":"为Qwen4提前选设备？Qwen3.8 27B、Flash-Next本地部署选购指南","discoveryCategory":null,"discoveryStage":null,"discoveryUrl":null,"sourcePath":"posts/local-llm-hardware-guide-20261031.md","fixedProductFooter":true},{"id":"obsidian:pika-h3-flex-localbrain-mac","rawId":"obsidian:pika-h3-flex-localbrain-mac","slug":"pika-h3-flex-localbrain-mac","legacyPaths":[],"title":"Pika H3 Flex把50步压成6步：64GB Mac实测3段有声视频，方寸智匣怎么用？","date":"2026-11-01","updated":"2026-11-01","summary":"50步如何压成6步？用官方动作、编辑与4K案例看懂技术，再看64GB Mac三条原片和方寸智匣2.2.4的实际用法。","categories":[{"id":"markdown-category-0-技术分享","name":"技术分享","color":"default"}],"categoryNames":["技术分享"],"tags":[{"id":"markdown-tag-0-AI","name":"AI","color":"default"},{"id":"markdown-tag-1-Pika","name":"Pika","color":"default"},{"id":"markdown-tag-2-本地部署","name":"本地部署","color":"default"}],"pageCover":"/obsidian-as